OVERVIEW: Print the Pixel Data Provider URL (0028,7FE0) of a JPIP-referenced
DICOM file

Reads a DICOM file that uses a JPIP Referenced Transfer Syntax and prints its
Pixel Data Provider URL (0028,7FE0), the JPIP request URL that stands in for
the
absent Pixel Data (PS3.5 8.4.1, A.6).

Examples:
  dicom-jpip uri study.dcm
  dicom-jpip uri study.dcm --json

USAGE: dicom-jpip uri <input> [--json]

ARGUMENTS:
  <input>                 DICOM file path

OPTIONS:
  --json                  Output as JSON
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

